  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ganesh Prallad Gaikwad And Others vs The Union Of India Through Its Secretary ... on 30 January, 2024 Author: Ravindra V. Ghuge Bench: Ravindra V. Ghuge 923-WP-1052-2024.odt IN THE HIGH COURT OF JUDICATURE OF BOMBAY BENCH AT AURANGABAD WRIT PETITION NO. 1052 OF 2024 GANESH PRALLAD GAIKWAD AND OTHERS VERSUS THE UNION OF INDIA THROUGH ITS SECRETARY AND OTHERS .... Mr. H. D. Deshmukh, Advocate for Petitioners Mr. A. N. Patale, Standing Counsel for Respondent Nos. 1 and 2 Mr. A. B. Girase, Government Pleader for Respondent Nos. 4 and 5 .... CORAM : RAVINDRA V. GHUGE AND Y. G. KHOBRAGADE, JJ. DATE : 30.01.2024 PER COURT :- 1. Leave to place on record the report of CAG and the Parliamentary Standing Committee, with proper pagination in continuation to the Petition paper-book. 2. The Petitioners have put forth prayer Clauses (B), (C) and (D) as under:- \"[B] Issue writ of mandamus or any other appropriate writ orders or directions in the like nature, thereby directing the respondents to maintain the right of equality of the exam pattern & syllabus for the post of Food Safety Officer and Assistant Commissioner (Food) Cum Designated Officer as like the other States in the Union of India as per the guidelines of respondent no.2, and for that purpose issue necessary orders. 1 of 2 (( 2 )) 923-WP-1052-2024 Ganesh Prallad Gaikwad And Others vs The Union Of India Through Its Secretary ... on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/99208516/ 1 [C] Hold and declare that, the post of Food Safety Officer and Assistant Commissioner (Food) Cum Designated Officer being the technical post requires expertise knowledge fulfilling the duties and responsibilities for which the exam pattern & syllabus for the competitive examinations in the screening and selection/recruitment process should have the relevance with the duties and responsibilities of the post,",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": ""
  },
